{
  "vector": "reminder-deferred-replay-keeps-attempt",
  "protocol": "2.0.0-draft.1",
  "summary": "A server reminder's send that got an ambiguous answer is replayed once the claim lease ends. When the gate defers that replay (the topic's quiet hours have begun), the row waits, and a waiting row is neither counted nor kept by a stop; the earlier attempt may have reached the player, so it is kept when the row is deferred. Cancelling the reminder then stops the waiting row, and another send of the topic the same day is still suppressed by frequency.maxPerDay: the provider is called once.",
